  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Zaalouk is one of the most common dishes in Moroccan "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "kemia ",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "kemia"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". The aubergine and tomato are cooked together until they collapse, then mashed with a fork. "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Smoked paprika",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "smoked-paprika-role"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " gives it colour and depth alongside the cumin."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Do not rush the cooking. The aubergine must be completely soft before you mash it, or the texture will be fibrous."
          }
        ]
      },
